Author: Nicholas Hemsley <nick.hems@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Jan 30 15:24:51 2026 +0800

    Filter invalid model IDs and refresh MRU list in model selector
    
    The model selector now:
    - Refreshes MRU models from database when showing the picker
    - Filters out old/invalid model IDs (ones without '/' character)
    - Adds logging for debugging MRU issues
    - Updates the delegate's MRU list with only valid IDs
    
    This prevents errors when trying to select old format model IDs
    and ensures the MRU list is always current.
    
    Closes zed-vb7.6

